    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d238">

                <pb facs="0670" n="548" xml:id="pg548"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr.
                            Mutsu.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State,</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-03-27"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 27,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the pleasure to inform you, having
                    reference to my note of the 12th instant, that on to-morrow (Thursday), the 28th
                    instant, I will be prepared to deliver to you a check for $15,000, being the
                    amount appropriated by Congress to be paid to the Japanese Government on account
                    of injuries caused to Japanese subjects by the explosion of shells from the U.
                    S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Omaha</hi>.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James G. Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
